SUMMARY:🍽 Pasta with RAGU
URL:https://claude.ai/artifact/Tnaf2fAybvVQGAEDS1mAjh
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 20 min\n\nSides: garlic bread\n\nNo meat — swapped
  from Sausage & Potato Soup (no Italian sausage on hand). Add garlic bread
  if still have a loaf.\n\nDouble the sauce and freeze half — saves a fut
 ure dinner. Use any pasta shape. Great Northern beans pureed into the sauc
 e for hidden fiber. Switched to whole wheat pasta for fiber — sauce mask
 s the flavor/color change.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1.5 lb 73% Lean / 27% Fat 
 Ground Beef\, 1 lb\n• 1 jar RAGU Chunky Pasta Sauce\, 24 oz\n• 1 box G
 reat Value Whole Wheat Linguine\, 16 oz\n• 0.25 jar Great Value Minced G
 arlic in Water\, 8 oz\n• 1 pkg Freshness Guaranteed Garlic Bread\, 16 oz
 \n• 1 can Great Value Great Northern Beans\, 15.5 oz\n\nDashboard: https
 ://claude.ai/artifact/Tnaf2fAybvVQGAEDS1mAjh
END:VEVENT
