SUMMARY:🍽 Mac and Cheese + Hot Dogs
URL:https://claude.ai/artifact/Tnaf2fAybvVQGAEDS1mAjh
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 20 min\n\nSides: sweet corn\n\nSlice the kielbasa in
 to coins and brown in a pan\, then stir into the mac. Add frozen broccoli 
 to the pasta water. White beans pureed into the cheese sauce for hidden fi
 ber and extra creaminess.\n\nIngredients:\n• 2 box Kraft Deluxe Mac and 
 Cheese\, 14 oz\n• 1 pkg Hillshire Farm Polska Kielbasa OR Johnsonville P
 olish Kielbasa\n• 1 bag Great Value Frozen Broccoli Florets\, 12 oz\n•
  0.25 gal Great Value Whole Vitamin D Milk\n• 0.25 pkg Great Value Sweet
  Cream Salted Butter\n• 1 can Great Value Great Northern Beans\, 15.5 oz
 \n\nDashboard: https://claude.ai/artifact/Tnaf2fAybvVQGAEDS1mAjh
END:VEVENT
