SUMMARY:🍽 Carnitas Tacos
URL:https://claude.ai/artifact/Tnaf2fAybvVQGAEDS1mAjh
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 240 min\n\nSides: refried beans / sweet corn\n\nMove
 d here from Aug 29 (Saturday) — that night's dinner became an ad hoc gri
 lled cheese + tomato soup audible instead. Since Carnitas Tacos is itself 
 a taco-night meal\, it now fills the Wed Sep 2 Taco Wednesday slot directl
 y rather than double-booking. Displaced Chicken Quesadillas (originally sl
 otted here) rolled forward to Sep 15. Pork shoulder needs to be on hand/th
 awed by Wednesday morning — reconfirm purchase timing since this was ori
 ginally planned as a Saturday pickup.\n\nSlow cook pork shoulder all day. 
 Broil briefly for crispy edges.\n\nIngredients:\n• 3 lb Pork Shoulder\n
 • 1 pkg Old El Paso Stand 'N Stuff Bold Nacho Cheese Taco Shells\n• 1 
 can Rosarita Traditional Refried Beans\n• 1 packet McCormick Chili Seaso
 ning Mix\n• 2 each Fresh Limes\n• 0.5 bag Fresh Green Cilantro\n• 0.
 25 bag Fresh Red Onions\n• 1 bag Great Value Colby Jack Shredded Cheese\
 n\nDashboard: https://claude.ai/artifact/Tnaf2fAybvVQGAEDS1mAjh
END:VEVENT
