SUMMARY:🍽 Leftover Chili + Jiffy Cornbread (~$0)
URL:https://claude.ai/artifact/Tnaf2fAybvVQGAEDS1mAjh
DESCRIPTION:💲 From scratch ~$11.58 · must-buy share ~$0.00\n\nCook time
 : 30 min\n\nDeep-freeze chili (~1 lb) + pantry Jiffy. Stretch over baked p
 otatoes if thin. PULL 3 lb ground beef to fridge tonight.\n\n✅ IN STOCK\
 n• 1 lb Leftover Chili (deep freeze) (deep freeze)\n• 1 box JIFFY Corn
  Muffin Mix (pantry)\n\n🥛 Staples: Eggs\, 18 ct / Whole Milk\n\n👩‍
 🍳 STEPS\n1. Heat chili from frozen in a covered pot over medium-low\, s
 tirring\, ~20 min.\n2. Mix Jiffy with 1 egg + 1/3 cup milk\; bake 400°F 1
 5–20 min in a greased 8×8.\n3. If the chili is thin for 5\, stretch it 
 with a can of beans or serve over baked potatoes.\n\nDashboard: https://cl
 aude.ai/artifact/Tnaf2fAybvVQGAEDS1mAjh
