DESCRIPTION:💲 From scratch ~$11.99 · must-buy share ~$0.00\n\nCook time
 : 60 min\n\nLeftover shredded pork (deep freeze ~1 lb\; thaw in cold water
 ) + BBQ sauce + cheese over baked russets. Deep-freeze broccoli.\n\n✅ IN
  STOCK\n• 1 lb Leftover Shredded Pork Shoulder (deep freeze) (deep freez
 e)\n• 3 lb Russet Potatoes (pantry)\n• 0.3 bottle BBQ Sauce (pantry)\n
 • 0.6 bag Shredded Cheese (Colby Jack)\, 8 oz bag (fridge)\n• 0.3 tub 
 Great Value Sour Cream\, 16 oz (fridge)\n• 1 bag Frozen Broccoli\, 12–
 16 oz (deep freeze)\n\n👩‍🍳 STEPS\n1. Thaw pork in a zip bag in col
 d water ~1 hr.\n2. Scrub 5–6 russets\, poke\, bake 400°F ~55 min (or mi
 crowave 10–12 min then oven 15).\n3. Warm pork with BBQ sauce in a skill
 et.\n4. Split potatoes\; load with pork\, cheese\, sour cream. Broccoli on
  the side.\n\nDashboard: https://claude.ai/artifact/Tnaf2fAybvVQGAEDS1mAjh
